config BR2_PACKAGE_CP2CL
	bool "cp2cl"
	help
	  CarPlay to CarLife bridge: the binary this repository builds, installed
	  as-is. It is statically linked against musl, so nothing here links
	  against it, and it reads nothing from the rootfs but the kernel's
	  configfs, FunctionFS and the access point's own hostapd.conf.
